<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RAINBOW CHICKEN GUTTED BY PROFIT WARNING.</title>
<headline>RAINBOW CHICKEN GUTTED BY PROFIT WARNING.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Rainbow Chicken Ltd slumped nine percent to a fresh year low of 70 cents as the struggling broiler producer warned yet again of big losses.</p>
</text>
